Package: fsct-host
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HEM Sp. z o.o. <support@hem-e.com>
Depends: systemd (>= 245)
Description: FSCT Host services (driver and per-user client)
 FSCT Host provides a system-wide driver daemon and per-user client integration for Ferrum Streaming Control Technology (R).
 It allows per-user clients to send their current player state to connected devices via a system driver.
